 "notes": [
  "Kiribati's balance of payments (BOP) goods lines and Kiribati's own customs returns agree once the months Kiribati has not yet published are allowed for. The difference between Kiribati's figures and partner-reported exports is tuna that importing countries code to Kiribati because the catching vessel flies the Kiribati flag; under balance-of-payments rules much of it may correctly sit outside Kiribati's goods exports.",
  "Partner-reported imports are a lower bound (only partners that publish on time appear; China's monthly data stop at 2024-12). No trade balance is shown or should be computed from these columns."
